    "Synthetic Canvas/Path2D recorder, not native raster/FPS evidence. Historical expected whole frames insert independently specified depleted ground commands at a hash-locked layer slot, adapt low-ore labels before layout and omit only exact validated ore tails; immutable v301 cue normalization remains separately exact.",
